          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef mahalanobis_qda_scores(x, mus, covs, priors) -> tuple[int, float]:\n    x_v = np.asarray(x, dtype=float)\n    scores = []\n    for mu, cov, pi in zip(mus, covs, priors):\n        mu_v = np.asarray(mu, dtype=float)\n        S = np.asarray(cov, dtype=float)\n        _, logdet = np.linalg.slogdet(S)\n        diff = x_v - mu_v\n        d2 = float(diff @ np.linalg.solve(S, diff))\n        scores.append(-0.5 * logdet - 0.5 * d2 + float(np.log(pi)))\n    pred = int(np.argmax(scores))\n    sorted_sc = sorted(scores)\n    margin = float(sorted_sc[-1] - sorted_sc[-2])\n    return (pred, round(margin, 4))\n```"
