          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef oas_shrinkage_audit(X) -> tuple[float, float]:\n    X_arr = np.asarray(X, dtype=float)\n    Xc = X_arr - X_arr.mean(axis=0)\n    n, d = Xc.shape\n    S = (Xc.T @ Xc) / n\n    tr_S = float(np.trace(S))\n    tr_S2 = float(np.sum(S ** 2))\n    mu = tr_S / d\n    num = (1.0 - 2.0 / d) * tr_S2 + tr_S ** 2\n    den = (n + 1.0 - 2.0 / d) * (tr_S2 - (tr_S ** 2) / d)\n    rho = 1.0 if den <= 1e-12 else float(np.clip(num / den, 0.0, 1.0))\n    S_oas = (1.0 - rho) * S + rho * mu * np.eye(d)\n    cond_oas = float(np.linalg.cond(S_oas))\n    return (round(rho, 4), round(cond_oas, 4))\n```"
